#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/11-oop-classes.md:814
msgid "First, the problem. A value computed **once** in `__init__` is a copy - it does not follow a later change of the attributes it came from:"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/11-oop-classes.md:831
msgid "`@property` above a method makes it look like an **attribute** - no brackets. Use it for values computed from the other attributes:"
msgstr ""

