#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/11-oop-classes.md:880
msgid "`@property` is a **decorator** (lecture 4, Advanced): it turns the method into a read-only attribute. A computed value never gets out of date, because it is computed each time it is read - like a computed column of an SQL view."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/11-oop-classes.md:899
