#. heading 3
#: site/lectures/11-oop-classes.md:1038
msgid "Validation: `__post_init__`"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/11-oop-classes.md:1040
msgid "`__post_init__` runs right after the written `__init__` - the place for checks and for computed fields:"
